chapter.v:
So also 


Christ did, 


not exalt himself to be made a high priest, but was appointed by him who said to him, “You are my Son, today I have begotten you”;

But solid 


food is, 


for the mature, for those who have their powers of discernment trained by constant practice to distinguish good from evil. Footnotes (1) 5:7 Greek *he* (ESV)
